    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">What is Lintel and who is it for?<svg class="faq-q-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Lintel is a property management platform built specifically for Nigerian real estate agencies. It combines client management, contracts and e-signing, property inventory, shortlet bookings, payments, and email communications into one workspace. It's designed for agencies of all sizes — from solo realtors using the free tier to multi-branch firms on the Business plan.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">How is Lintel different from international CRMs like HubSpot or Salesforce?<svg class="faq-q-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Lintel is purpose-built for Nigerian real estate, not adapted from a generic CRM. That means Naira-native pricing, multi-director vendor signing, NDPA compliance, Nigerian contract law defaults, and workflows designed around how agencies here actually work. International CRMs typically cost far more per seat and miss the contract, shortlet, and payment workflows critical to Nigerian agencies.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Is Lintel NDPA-compliant?<svg class="faq-q-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. Lintel is built around Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 requirements — including data subject rights, breach notification procedures, retention limits, and lawful basis tracking. We also support GDPR considerations for agencies serving EU and UK diaspora clients. Full details are in our <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">How long does setup take?<svg class="faq-q-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Most agencies are operational in under 15 minutes. You can sign up, import an existing client list from a CSV, create your first contract template, and send a signing request — all within one sitting. For larger agencies migrating from existing systems, our team can help with bulk imports and template setup.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Can I import clients from my existing spreadsheet or CRM?<svg class="faq-q-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. Lintel supports CSV and Excel imports for clients, properties, and historical contracts. The Starter plan and above includes guided import wizards. For complex migrations from existing systems, our team can assist.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">What payment methods can I accept through Lintel?<svg class="faq-q-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Lintel integrates with Flutterwave for card payments, bank transfers, USSD, and wallet payments. You can also manually record offline payments (cash, manual bank transfers, cheques) and Lintel will generate receipts with consistent per-agency numbering for accounting purposes.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">How much does Lintel cost?<svg class="faq-q-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Lintel starts free for solo realtors. Paid tiers begin at ₦12,000/month for Starter (3 users), ₦35,000/month for Pro (10 users with unlimited records and shortlet features), and ₦100,000/month for Business (unlimited users, multi-agency support, API access).</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Is there a free trial?<svg class="faq-q-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. We offer a 14-day free trial of the Pro plan with no credit card required. You can also start on the Free tier indefinitely and upgrade only when you need more capacity.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">What support is available?<svg class="faq-q-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">All plans include email support via <a href="contact.html">our contact page</a>. Starter and above includes priority email support. Pro and Business plans include direct chat support and onboarding assistance. Business customers get a dedicated account manager.</div></div></div>
    </div>
